@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-privately-with-local-synthetic-test-token
@jobId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@consentGeneration = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### Capability: no records and no inference
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-prediction-jobs/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit synthetic-only data; set now to the current test clock before use.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-prediction-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operationId":"{{jobId}}","consentVersion":"sleep-ai-jobs-v1","consentGeneration":"{{consentGeneration}}","request":{"schemaVersion":2,"inputRevision":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","consentVersion":"sleep-ai-v2","familyId":null,"membershipId":null,"historyId":null,"ageDays":100,"timeZone":"Australia/Melbourne","now":"2026-10-14T09:15:00+11:00","records":[],"previousEstimate":null}}

### Resume the same committed task after a disconnected POST; no new generation.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-prediction-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel even an unknown POST outcome; late admission cannot recreate this ID.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-prediction-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke one account-bound consent generation, including pending late POSTs.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-prediction-jobs/consents/{{consentGeneration}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown and another account's IDs are indistinguishable: 404 job_not_found.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-prediction-jobs/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
